{"id":"db1cdbf32eacfd38","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md","title":"Nowhere Dense","display":"df-nowhere-dense — Nowhere Dense","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-nowhere-dense","aliases":["58-df-nowhere-dense"],"display":"df-nowhere-dense — Nowhere Dense","depends_on":["[[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-nowhere-dense"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-nowhere-dense</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-nowhere-dense — Nowhere Dense"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-interior.md\">../batch04/58-df-interior.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(X,\\tau)\">\\((X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological space)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\">\\(\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\)</span> (topological-space predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-interior.md\">../batch04/58-df-interior.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\subseteq X\">\\(A\\subseteq X\\)</span> (subset)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X\">\\(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X\">\\(\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X\\)</span> (topological closure and interior, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"3df866ee4574e842\" href=\"?note=3df866ee4574e842\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-interior.md\">../batch04/58-df-interior.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X)\">\\(\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X)\\)</span> (nowhere-dense predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense} \\vdash \\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A))=\\emptyset\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense} \\vdash \\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A))=\\emptyset\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Nowhere dense sets have empty interior of closure.</li>\n<li>They are the building blocks of meager sets.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch04/58-df-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"3df866ee4574e842","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"3df866ee4574e842","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)$ (topological-space predicate, see [[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-interior.md","status":"resolved","id":"3df866ee4574e842","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X$ and $\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X$ (topological closure and interior, see [[../batch04/58-df-interior.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)","display":false},{"tex":"A\\subseteq X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}nowhere\\text{-}dense} \\vdash \\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(A;X) \\leftrightarrow \\operatorname{TopologicalSpace}_S(X,\\tau)\\land A\\subseteq X\\land\\operatorname{int}_\\tau^X(\\operatorname{cl}_\\tau^X(A))=\\emptyset","display":true}],"bytes":1035,"backlinks":[{"id":"d816c9cae96d1191","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau(\\cdot;X)$ (nowhere-dense predicate, see [[../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md]])"},{"id":"834288cc700cc4bd","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NowhereDense}_\\tau$ (nowhere-dense predicate; see [[58-df-nowhere-dense]])"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-890","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-df-nowhere-dense.md|58-df-nowhere-dense]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["3df866ee4574e842"]}